{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_title", "source_sha256": "36bd1f5e2dd2607b94e1a8c8e2d47750dc66f1bb1b19e8602c1863a29b225d55", "ja": "ふたりのはじまり", "zh": "两人的开始", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f02933de80277773e3255a3be03a4d820dfbe03f7fc24277d07499d874ff4dc7", "ja": "千早から夏祭りに誘われた昴は、戸惑いを\n隠せずにいた。夏祭り当日、約束した神社で\n千早に会う昴。改めて姉妹になってほしいと\n言われ理由を尋ねると、千早は素直に自分の\n思いを話す。二人の姉妹は、漸く始まった。", "zh": "被千早邀请参加夏日祭典的昴，始终无法掩饰自己的困惑。夏日祭典当天，昴在约定的神社见到了千早。千早再次提出希望两人成为姐妹，昴询问理由后，千早坦率地说出了自己的心意。两人的姐妹关系终于开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1000_se", "source_sha256": "f98f4cdb4e7b7d62a2dbbd0a5a370f5f947a3f027cc94e2530dd88cc113b1ccd", "ja": "キーンコーン\nカーンコーン", "zh": "叮——咚——\n铛——咚——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1001_jyoseito", "source_sha256": "8539317d429514e875f19f953c30879b9640f0fe3d6f68e8508115c2e87e73c3", "ja": "永吉さん。千早さんが、入口に来てらっしゃるわ。\n貴女を呼んでほしいって。", "zh": "永吉小姐，千早小姐到入口来了。她说想请您过去一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "bd5115904566528fa014e55e278dc2849bbee43b987e076ad33a1235eac97303", "ja": "？　千早さんが……？", "zh": "咦？千早小姐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "d79c57d047f4537e0e46e4fac4e7b1d4615146e9653a83a527025564cda538b3", "ja": "ご、ごきげんよう。\nあの、どうかしたんですか……？", "zh": "那、那个，您好。\n请问，您这是怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "a1615c30e15427b8b75ebffe312c87c3bba8a036c3c92beefe098e481d4ab81d", "ja": "突然ごめんなさい。今日は、貴女を誘いに来たの。\n……夏休みに、私とお祭りに行きませんか？", "zh": "突然来打扰，真是抱歉。今天是来邀请你的。\n……暑假要不要和我一起去参加祭典？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "10d503dcb0216730504fb52c386003c4a0f259fd0921376c4f73acf79145e179", "ja": "えっ……わ、わたし？　でも可憐さんとか、\n最上さんのほうがいいんじゃ……。", "zh": "诶……我、我吗？可是可怜小姐，还有最上小姐她们，不是更合适吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1006_002chi", "source_sha256": "b98fc8d9dc42c9b35ca9245dff990a44880ec9d4981b23a6eda74c2d9dca65aa", "ja": "私が、貴女と行きたいと思ったの。\n良ければ来てほしいけど、無理にとは言わないわ。", "zh": "是我，想和你一起去。\n如果你愿意的话，希望你能来，但我不会勉强你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "3453f59be88fcd89289bca4e8acfe79e3cd0d42cd63a6d28d9bad39b2484de09", "ja": "場所は、ここからすぐ近くの実里恩神社よ。\nもし来てくれるなら、今度の土曜……16時に。", "zh": "地点就在离这里很近的实里恩神社。\n要是你愿意来的话，就定在周六……16点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1008_null", "source_sha256": "d0a01631f8640d991fc5124385ec97cfe241177b3db6a20518cef79aa9a653ec", "ja": "土曜日……", "zh": "星期六……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "5806ca08bc645295928ddea3d882d91f4dccf4973a96610fae7cc93643188609", "ja": "来ちゃった……。", "zh": "我还是来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "bd5458a228228f43eb5a7b9acb8059e3c57688d10dae40989957f418b5f2e0dd", "ja": "（わたしなんかが、来ていいのかなって思ったけど。\nでも、聞けるかもしれないから。千早さんの答え……）", "zh": "（我本来还在想，像我这样的人来这里真的好吗？不过，说不定能听到……千早的答案……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "8f7abf27d6af632d643ecf3d3f4bc02e925d1db3c4e02246133217e411aa10f1", "ja": "永吉さん。\nよかった、来てくれたのね。ありがとう。", "zh": "永吉小姐。\n太好了，你愿意来。谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "876d7fb5673a080ac1d2d8f4707d795bde0b8ea94571608394585eb4106b213e", "ja": "永吉さん。……いえ、昴さん。", "zh": "永吉小姐。……不，昴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "fbb30968bc7188e1bd94aecf6c046b6ba1b3cfd8585a07fafb2833fe5e5ed7d5", "ja": "は、はい……！？", "zh": "啊、啊……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "e79a9f35c87b1bca6e76c132c0473b237b1283f715d05986ad3bc3eb78b47265", "ja": "（千早さんに、名前……初めて呼ばれた）", "zh": "（千早姐第一次叫了我的名字……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "439575d4ea98a48c7a6b7eac478632474692db2ba6cc0dca4a26320b55c85617", "ja": "改めてお願いするわ。\n……私と、姉妹になってほしいの。", "zh": "我再郑重地拜托你一次。\n……请你和我成为姐妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "ec26a92274f9095dccf856d3ef74aa0cd9daf65ed7af0523344e3ceea6bc4445", "ja": "あの、そのことなんですけど……\nどうしてわたしなのか、聞いてもいいですか？", "zh": "那个，关于那件事……\n能问问为什么选我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "665a9c43de4ed30d84f01cf1b406511982ba72e67d1e7071047142311f5fa0fc", "ja": "そうね。上手く言えないのだけど……\n私が、貴女がいいと思ったの。", "zh": "是啊。虽然我不太会表达……但我觉得，还是你比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "d7a161e00abe78362f913ece336ebecbac0a612d90d84bd67c9582b11d28ef2c", "ja": "だから、貴女がいいと思った、\nその理由なら言えるわ。", "zh": "所以，我可以说出觉得是你的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "ce79ee8a4dcdd4f341183ac8fb048eaa0d55a931e3d85713219db021cbdbe532", "ja": "え。……えっと。\nじゃあ、聞いてもいいですか……？", "zh": "诶……那个。\n那我可以问问吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1020_002chi", "source_sha256": "2a65fc084de2db295f714fb2625c2c7fbd0cf5f9ea17c836fec9a11eb8019a84", "ja": "貴女は1年生だけど、とてもしっかりしているわ。\nお友達が多くて、みんなに好かれていて……。", "zh": "你虽然是1年级，却非常稳重。朋友很多，也很受大家喜欢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "82be73a902744f3ca0805398b79ac0ed722903e5ddd827448b3e39c29d87b1b0", "ja": "自分の考えを持っていて、言いにくい事も、\nきちんと言葉にして伝えてくれる。今回のように。", "zh": "我有自己的想法，就连难以启齿的事情，也会好好地用语言表达出来告诉别人。就像这次一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "89e79b059e69b8904287925b324177d9d3acddcbe29457f48a73c8538d7fd6c8", "ja": "私、何故かみんなから遠巻きにされているでしょう。\n私自身、歌にしか興味がないせいかもしれないけど。", "zh": "我总是被大家敬而远之，你也看出来了吧。\n也许是因为我自己只对歌唱感兴趣的缘故。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "1674302a70406b0bc9bbc578071d3bcfa99ffc7a96bf048bf4015741b95ed04f", "ja": "だから、私の駄目なところを指摘してくれるのは、\n静香と可憐お姉さまだけだったの。貴女で3人目よ。", "zh": "所以，愿意指出我的缺点的，只有静香和可怜姐姐。算上你，这是第3个人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "34fb502c072a9dcb698defbd9e109e2ce0c644602821f6ca29245118b65038a1", "ja": "ち、千早さんは素敵です！　考え直してほしいなんて、\nわたし、生意気なこと言っちゃったのに……！", "zh": "千、千早姐很棒！明明我还说了这么不知天高地厚的话，希望你能重新考虑一下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "a80b0a51fa02179cde80bc1df99f612b32fe178894c722d14980fbb43055826e", "ja": "後輩のわたしの言ったことを、ちゃんと考えてくれて\n……ダメじゃなくて、いいところだと思います！", "zh": "明明我只是个后辈，说了那种话，您却能认真去考虑……\n我觉得这不是缺点，而是您的优点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1026_002chi", "source_sha256": "7dde92160f2c9de6614ed3040565861ae4adeb222469b13fec5544bcbb5f34c1", "ja": "……ふふ。", "zh": "……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "4cc015bfeb420dca77e0699e58aa65b45ed75d00ce3930aca543866a40abd0c9", "ja": "……あは。", "zh": "……啊哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "c38e9c3f9830078e11b4d50e60359326679f40ba01385c66ac39052da8a9717c", "ja": "……改めて、お願いするわ。\n昴さん。私の妹になってくれる？", "zh": "……我要郑重地，再拜托你一次。\n昴。你愿意做我的妹妹吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "202613a879fa70d77b69446f0848d928df279e8cc18897cb249346cb0968dca5", "ja": "はい！　あ、あと、えっと……\n妹になるなら、『昴』でいいです。昴さんじゃなくて。", "zh": "好的！啊，还有，那个……\n既然要成为妹妹，就叫我“昴”就好了。不用叫昴小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1030_002chi", "source_sha256": "da2bdedb181d775277c1d57c874d375454b48557f8e2fb835db5034250a2bf02", "ja": "ありがとう。なら私のことも、\nいつか『お姉さま』と呼んでくれるかしら？", "zh": "谢谢你。那以后，\n你也能试着叫我一声“姐姐大人”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "f70c1fb3f0f1e0f7ecc23d99bf06add68204aa5cb46de97a00758d1c1ff70211", "ja": "！　え、えっと、それは……。", "zh": "！呃、呃，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1032_002chi", "source_sha256": "db09b8584c5cee4c4e23ecd21412008fef686a91af7326c67c7337447f62e226", "ja": "ゆっくりでいいの。\n……私達のペースで、姉妹になっていきましょう。", "zh": "慢慢来就好。\n……按我们的步调，渐渐成为真正的姐妹吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0412_story_11_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_11_1033_047sub", "source_sha256": "f9384068d8ef64586e102b8690994e23fd8037369edae78b507385c459bf2789", "ja": "……はい！", "zh": "……好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
